{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to Kollectomaniac</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/b2d6a91c2561bf00407236749d12643c.avif?t=1773771388\" width=1560 height=219 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/afed8ce5816d5f4cbfb5c347c0706893.poster.avif?t=1773771388\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/afed8ce5816d5f4cbfb5c347c0706893.webm?t=1773771388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/afed8ce5816d5f4cbfb5c347c0706893.mp4?t=1773771388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and sell items to Walkers to make a profit. Each run is a little different. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast gameplay, quick calculation, and planning are vital!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post early acess will over trippe the number of unqiue Walkers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/d28b44d5e8cc8618cb3f842b6c65120d.avif?t=1773771388\" width=1560 height=219 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/a680fbda705e28e64b5fb71fa8b0a920.poster.avif?t=1773771388\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/a680fbda705e28e64b5fb71fa8b0a920.webm?t=1773771388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=